msgid "A [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") can be broken down in two different ways, and they are not interchangeable:\n"
msgstr "Une [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") peut être décomposée de deux façons différentes, qui ne sont pas interchangeables :\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decomposehttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionscircuit-fermionic-circuitqiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose-qiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose}"
msgstr "[`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") {#decomposehttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionscircuit-fermionic-circuitqiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose-qiskit-fermionscircuitfermioniccircuitdecompose}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expands the gate into its *definition*: the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") of the reference followed by the full [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). This is equivalent to the gate as an *operator*, for any input state.\n"
msgstr "Développe la porte en sa *définition* : l'[`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") de la référence suivie de l'[`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") complète. Cela équivaut à la porte en tant qu'*opérateur*, pour tout état d'entrée.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`, applied by [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesishttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionstranspiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesisqiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis-qiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis}"
msgstr "`PrepareSlaterDeterminant.synthesis`, appliquée par [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") {#prepareslaterdeterminantsynthesis-applied-by-f2fsynthesishttpsdocsquantumibmcomapiqiskit-fermionstranspiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesisqiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis-qiskit-fermionstranspilerpassesf2fsynthesis}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replaces the gate with the reduced decomposition of this guide. This is equivalent to the gate only as a *state preparation*: it produces the same determinant, up to a global phase, when the modes start in the vacuum. It is cheaper precisely because it assumes that.\n"
msgstr "Remplace la porte par la décomposition réduite de ce guide. Cela n'équivaut à la porte qu'en tant que *préparation d'état* : elle produit le même déterminant, à une phase globale près, lorsque les modes partent du vide. Elle est moins coûteuse précisément parce qu'elle suppose cela.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the synthesis when the gate prepares a state on the vacuum, which is what the gate is for and what the transpiler does for you. Use [`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") when the gate has to keep acting as an operator, for example because other gates precede it on the same modes, or when you want to inspect or simulate the plain gates. The [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") pass cannot know which case it is looking at, so it is up to the circuit you give it to prepare the determinant from the vacuum.\n"
msgstr "Utilise la synthèse lorsque la porte prépare un état à partir du vide, ce pour quoi elle est faite et ce que le transpiler fait pour toi. Utilise [`decompose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.decompose\") lorsque la porte doit continuer d'agir comme un opérateur, par exemple parce que d'autres portes la précèdent sur les mêmes modes, ou lorsque tu veux inspecter ou simuler les portes simples. La passe [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") ne peut pas savoir à quel cas elle a affaire ; c'est donc au circuit que tu lui fournis de préparer le déterminant à partir du vide.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulating a circuit with ffsim needs neither: every gate applies its whole unitary, so a circuit holding a [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") is simulated as it is, and stays on the fast path for the [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates around it. Breaking only the Slater gate down with `circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` leaves those rotations whole, too.\n"
msgstr "Simuler un circuit avec ffsim n'exige ni l'une ni l'autre : chaque porte applique son unitaire complet, de sorte qu'un circuit contenant une [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") est simulé tel quel, et reste sur la voie rapide pour les portes [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") qui l'entourent. Décomposer uniquement la porte de Slater avec `circuit.decompose(\"PrepareSlaterDeterminant\")` laisse aussi ces rotations intactes.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"See also\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\"), [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\"), [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\"), and the [LUCJ guide](lucj#lucj-transpilation) for the workflow that produces the global-initialization pattern.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Voir aussi\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"), [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\"), [`F2FSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\"), [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\"), et le [guide LUCJ](lucj#lucj-transpilation) pour le flux de travail qui produit le motif d'initialisation globale.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
